---
import Base   from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import TopNav from '../../components/TopNav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Legitimate Interest Assessment (LIA) - Debanjan Mazumdar"
  description="LIA on file for B2B cold outreach conducted from debanjanm.com under GDPR legitimate-interest basis."
  path="/legal/lia"
>
  <TopNav />
  <main class="section">
    <article class="section-inner max-w-prose2">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-4">Legitimate Interest Assessment (LIA)</h1>
      <p class="text-ink-500 mb-10">
        Effective: 2026-07-08. Reviewed by operator every 12 months minimum.
        Kept on file per GDPR / CNIL requirement for B2B cold email using
        legitimate-interest basis.
      </p>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-3">Controller</h2>
        <ul class="text-ink-500 space-y-1">
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Name:</strong> Debanjan Mazumdar (dba ProdCraft)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Address:</strong> [TO_FILL - postal address per legal/lia.md]</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Contact:</strong> debolshop@gmail.com</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-3">Purpose test - legitimate interest identified</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-500 leading-relaxed">
          The controller has a legitimate business interest in identifying and
          initiating first contact with B2B decision-makers (Founders, Heads of
          Product / Ops, Agency Owners) who have public-facing indicators of
          needing AI product-engineering services. The interest is commercial
          (client acquisition) and lawful.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-3">Necessity test - is direct outreach necessary?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-500 mb-2">Direct email outreach to publicly-listed business contacts is necessary because:</p>
        <ol class="text-ink-500 list-decimal pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>The prospect's job function makes them the correct decision-maker for the service offered.</li>
          <li>No other channel reliably reaches this ICP at the scale needed (LinkedIn DM open rates are lower; cold call is more intrusive; ad targeting does not reach the specific individual).</li>
          <li>The volume (20 / day, 600 / month) is proportionate to a solo operator's capacity, not a mass-broadcast pattern.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-3">Balancing test - the prospect's rights and interests</h2>
        <ul class="text-ink-500 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Data used:</strong> only publicly-listed business email address, name, title, company. No personal data outside professional context. No special-category data.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Reasonable expectation:</strong> decision-makers at businesses reasonably expect to receive relevant B2B service pitches to their business email.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Impact:</strong> minimal - one email, unsubscribe available in every message, follow-up capped at 2 messages, immediate suppression on opt-out.</li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-ink-800">Safeguards implemented:</strong>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Unsubscribe link in every email (Instantly-tracked).</li>
              <li>Physical postal address in every email footer.</li>
              <li>Opt-out honoured automatically (<code>suppression.json</code>, minimum 30-day retention).</li>
              <li>Explicit "reply STOP" pattern also honoured via reply classifier's <code>negative</code> bucket.</li>
              <li>Anti-ICP filter rejects roles unlikely to want the offer (recruiters, students, interns).</li>
              <li>Language gate: emails only to prospects with public content in EN or FR (the operator's working languages).</li>
              <li>Domain suppression: never contact prospects from operator's client / lockdown domains.</li>
            </ol>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-3">Data retention</h2>
        <ul class="text-ink-500 space-y-1">
          <li>Contacted prospects: retained in campaign log for 12 months, then archived.</li>
          <li>Suppressed prospects: retained indefinitely on suppression list (regulatory floor 30 days).</li>
          <li>Reply content: retained 24 months for follow-up / audit trail, then deleted.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-3">Rights the prospect has</h2>
        <ul class="text-ink-500 space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Right to object</strong> (unsubscribe link + reply STOP): honoured immediately, permanent suppression.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Right to access:</strong> prospect may email debolshop@gmail.com to request all data held.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Right to erasure:</strong> honoured on request, though suppression record (email address only) must be retained per anti-spam obligations.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink-800">Right to lodge complaint</strong> with CNIL (data.gouv.fr / cnil.fr).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-3">Outcome</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-500 leading-relaxed">
          Legitimate-interest basis is <strong class="text-ink-800">valid</strong> for this outreach subject to
          the safeguards above. Reviewed by operator on 2026-07-08. Next review: 2027-07-08.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="rule-top pt-6 mt-10 text-sm text-ink-500">
        <a href="/" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink-800">Back to home</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
